    {
      "block_id": "h2-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Extraction Decision",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**No extraction needed.** The production adapters are already well-factored:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `AnthropicAdapter` is a full-featured base class with 15+ methods - `VertexAnthropicAdapter(AnthropicAdapter)` inherits **all** parsing/streaming/cache/thinking logic - Only `__init__()` and `prepare_request()` are overridden for Vertex-specific auth/endpoint - `AnthropicMapper` is a standalone mapper used by both",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The overlap was in the **tests**, not the production code.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-12",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Test Consolidation",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Before",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "28 Vertex tests duplicated Anthropic mapper/adapter tests: - `TestParseFullResponse` (6 tests) — duplicate of `AnthropicMapper.parse_response` - `TestStreamingEvents` (13 tests) — duplicate of `AnthropicMapper.parse_streaming_event` - `TestHelperMethods` (9 tests) — duplicate of `AnthropicAdapter` helpers",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "After",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "4 lightweight contract tests replaced the 28 duplicates: - `TestAdapterInheritanceContract::test_inherits_parse_response` — proves Vertex delegates to AnthropicAdapter - `TestAdapterInheritanceContract::test_inherits_streaming_events` — proves streaming parse inheritance - `TestAdapterInheritanceContract::test_inherits_cache_control` — proves cache control inheritance - `TestAdapterInheritanceContract::test_inherits_thinking_detection` — proves thinking detection inheritance",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Vertex-specific tests preserved (18 tests): - `TestBuildVertexEndpoint` (5 tests) — endpoint/URL construction - `TestPrepareRequest` (8 tests) — Vertex-specific auth/endpoint/project/region request building - `TestVertexCredentials` (5 tests) — ADC token lifecycle",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-18",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Lines Changed",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-19",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "File",
        "Before",
        "After",
        "Change"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "`tests/backend/test_vertex_anthropic_adapter.py`",
          "637",
          "~299",
          "−338 lines (−53%)"
        ]
      ],
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Provider-Specific Seams",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Kept separate: - API key/env var loading (`AnthropicAdapter.__init__` vs `VertexAnthropicAdapter.__init__` + `VertexCredentials`) - Endpoint construction (`build_vertex_endpoint`, `build_vertex_base_url`) - Request body (Vertex uses `anthropic_version: vertex-2023-10-16`, Anthropic uses `anthropic-version` header) - Auth (API key vs Google ADC) - Beta features (Vertex has none, Anthropic may have)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h3-22",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Risks",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- `test_inherits_streaming_events` and `test_inherits_thinking_detection` fail on pre-existing `vibe` module references (not caused by this change) - VertexCredentials tests also fail on pre-existing `vibe` references (5 of 5)",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
