    {
      "block_id": "p-27",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "No remaining adapter overlap. The Anthropic ↔ Vertex Anthropic relationship is cleanly modeled as inheritance. Future Anthropic-family adapters (e.g., AWS Bedrock Anthropic) can follow the same pattern.",
